Affected timeframes:
US region: 05:14 to 06:41 UTC and 14:55 to 15:48 UTC
EU region: 14:55 to 15:48 UTC

Based on our analysis, approximately 25% of US inbound traffic and 50% of EU inbound traffic had a chance to have been impacted during these windows. We&#x27;re unable to provide exact counts due to gaps in our logging for rejected inbound mail, which we have since corrected.</description></item><item><title>Delayed Message Processing in US [resolved]</title><link>https://stspg.io/5534ts1c2fpm</link><guid isPermaLink="false">mailgun:2025-10-24T07:14:52.057-07:00</guid><pubDate>Fri, 24 Oct 2025 14:14:52 +0000</pubDate><description>This incident has been resolved.</description></item></channel></rss>